   "legacy_id": "C3",
   "role": "intermediate_claim",
   "level": "L4",
   "content": {
    "text": "Refund checks and pressure for more defense spending mean tariff revenue will not tighten fiscal policy, so the macro channel for cutting the deficit is closed.",
    "label": null,
    "explicit": true,
    "reason": "If tax revenue is recycled into spending, the tax does not raise national saving."
   },
   "source": {
    "passages": [
     {
      "paragraph_id": "p16",
      "relation": "states",
      "link_method": "llm_citation",
      "anchor_grade": "excerpt",
      "review_status": "pending",
      "source_excerpt": "At this stage, though, it seems unlikely that the tariffs will drive a significant fiscal adjustment—the refund checks are coming, and there is strong pressure to increase defense spending."
